# The ACN Newswire API is reached through this origin's /wire proxy, NOT directly
# — see src/lib/api/client.ts, vite.config.ts and vercel.json. Leave this unset
# and the app does the right thing in dev and in production.
#
# ⚠️  Do NOT set this to https://development.acnnewswire.com.
#
# That is what the app used to do, and it is what broke the deployment: the API's
# CORS is an allowlist, so a direct browser call succeeds from one whitelisted
# localhost port and is blocked from every deployed origin. Setting this variable
# overrides the proxy and re-introduces exactly that failure.
#
# Set it only to point at a DIFFERENT proxy or a local mock, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
